  "content": "<h1>光标增强版</h1><p><img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/default.png\" alt=\"默认\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/pointing_hand.png\" alt=\"指向手\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/grabbing.png\" alt=\"抓取\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/ibeam.png\" alt=\"工字光标\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/shift.png\" alt=\"Shift键\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/busy.gif\" alt=\"忙碌\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/not_allowed.png\" alt=\"禁止\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/crosshair.png\" alt=\"十字准星\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_all.png\" alt=\"全方位缩放\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ew.png\" alt=\"水平缩放\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ns.png\" alt=\"垂直缩放\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nwse.png\" alt=\"对角线缩放1\"> <img src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nesw.png\" alt=\"对角线缩放2\"></p><p>以《我的世界》主题光标替换枯燥的旧版默认系统光标。</p><p>在1.21.9版本对模组进行大量破坏性改动前，该模组曾名为<a href=\"https://github.com/fishstiz/minecraft-cursor/blob/master/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Cursor</a>。</p><h2>📌 前置需求</h2><ul>\n<li>若使用Fabric：需安装Fabric API</li>\n</ul><h2>✨ 功能特性</h2><ul>\n<li>使用资源包自定义光标纹理</li>\n<li>为光标添加动态动画效果</li>\n<li>内置适用于不同场景的额外光标样式</li>\n<li>通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fminecraft-cursor-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fgetting-started%2523all-cursors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>传统模式</strong></a>强化各类GUI组件的光标交互逻辑</li>\n<li>可自由调节多项设置：进入模组界面 或 选项 › 控制 › 鼠标设置 › 光标设置</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1338/150/cursors_extended-gif.gif\" alt=\"光标增强版展示\"></p><h2>🖌️ 创建资源包</h2><p>制作专属资源包，在支持平台上分享，即可在此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fshowcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">展示</a>！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fshowcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishstiz/resources/refs/heads/main/cursors-extended/showcase.gif\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"展示图\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bedrock-style-cursors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dUA5FyFq/images/28f9504fa044c59491a1555494b3e579eec186a1.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"基岩版风格光标\">\n</a></p><hr><p>已为Minecraft Cursor v3版本制作了资源包？请使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252ftools%252f%2523v3-converter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>V3转换器</strong></a>进行转换。</p><p>从以下链接开始：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffishstiz.github.io%252fcursors_extended-wiki%252fresource-pack%252fgetting-started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started</a></p>",
